PISA attention

An implementation of the PISA paper's mathematical definitions, with optional
adapters to publicly licensed GPU primitives.

The optional fla-core==0.5.2 dependency provides selected attention and, for
supported BSA full-prefill inputs, mean_pooling and parallel_nsa_topk. These
primitives are called from the installed dependency; their source is not bundled
here. General BSA inputs retain PISA's position-aware routing implementation.

