The SiLU gate/linear autograd operator is adapted from the public xopes code
at commit 33afe26100f8590272940e55dbee5067a8040da6, under
Apache-2.0 (xopes authors; author/maintainer Zhen Qin). Source paths:
xopes/xopes/ops/gate_linear/gate_linear_ag.py and
xopes/xopes/ops/act/_act_torch/act_torch.py. This package keeps the SiLU
training specialization and its activation-dtype backward arithmetic.
